    "detailed_description": "Cosmic Survivor is an intense, survival shoot 'em up with roguelite elements, where your skill is on trial and the horde is always waiting. Features a short game loop with rising intensity. Learn the best survival strategy or upgrade your ship over time to climb the Global Leaderboard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOriginally developed for mobile VR, this free version is the full game for Windows. If you'd like to support the developer you can purchase a VR version on AppLabs for the MetaQuest.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLike living dangerously? Jump straight to maniac levels of intensity by pressing &quot;6&quot; on the keyboard at six seconds on the clock.",
